    "name": "Bambi 2025",
    "overview": "On November 13, 2025, the time has come once again: the BAMBI, Germany’s most prestigious media award, will be presented for the 77th time – to people who shape our times. People who inspire hope, give courage, and enrich and advance our society through their creativity, dedication, and humanity.",
